evals.prompt:
Make a data model diagram (SVG) from this schema:

CREATE TABLE customers (id uuid primary key, email text unique not null, name text);
CREATE TABLE plans (code text primary key, price_cents int not null, interval text not null);
CREATE TABLE subscriptions (id uuid primary key, customer_id uuid references customers(id), plan_code text references plans(code), status text not null);
CREATE TABLE invoices (id uuid primary key, subscription_id uuid references subscriptions(id), total_cents int not null, due_on date);
CREATE TABLE payments (id uuid primary key, invoice_id uuid references invoices(id), amount_cents int not null);

Draw a class diagram SVG of these TypeScript types:

interface StateCommand { run(ctx: Context): boolean }
class EditorView { state: EditorState; dispatch(tr: Transaction): void; focus(): void }
class MarkdownFormatting implements StateCommand { toggleBold(): boolean; insertLink(url: string): boolean; run(ctx: Context): boolean }
class Repo<T> { find(id: string): T }

EditorView dispatches StateCommands and reads a Repo<Note>.
